   "title": "Adrenal disease: one zone making TOO MUCH, or the whole cortex making TOO LITTLE",
   "lines": [
    "glomerulosa → aldosterone · fasciculata → cortisol · reticularis → androgens · medulla → catecholamines",
    "always ask about exogenous steroid · a random cortisol is uninterpretable"
   ]
  },
